The file are renamed as *_rar as the .ko extension files are not intended to be at any place other than /lib/module/.... as per system engineering team recommendations. 

While copy to the kernel folder it will be renamed to .ko extension.

Since there are multiple OS in field and there are different implemtantion on this KO logic, these below KO are 
Applicable to OS version : 13.1.2 or later

